==Description==
The '''Guest''' was an enemy that appeared in [[Pls Donate]] as part of the [[Tower Defense Simulator x PLS DONATE Event]]. It was faster and has higher health than the [[Noob]] that appeared before it. On some waves, it was a [[Hidden (Attribute)|Hidden]] enemy. Additionally, on some waves, it spawned with the [[Bloated]], [[Nimble]] and [[Slime (Attribute)|Slime]] attributes.

==Appearance==
The '''Guest''' had white skin. It wore a black shirt and pants that covered up most of its body, alongside a black and red cap. It had a large Roblox logo on its shirt, specifically the one used between the 26th of September 2009 up until the 11th of August 2010. On its sleeves, "''GUEST''" could be seen written in red.

==Strategy==
*Early game towers like the [[Crook Boss]], [[Militant]] or [[Military Base]] can be useful against it.
*As this enemy spawns in hordes, AOE towers like the [[Pyromancer]], [[Mortar]] or [[Electroshocker]] can be useful against them.

