==Trivia==
*The '''Guest''' is based on [[w:c:roblox:Guest|Guests]], more specifically the male guest avatar used between the 5th of April 2011 up until 12th of July 2016. which is also known as {{RLinkU|BillyBloxxer}}.
*The cap worn by the '''Guest''' is the {{RLinkC|48474313|Red Roblox Cap}} from the Roblox catalog.

